.nh
.TH "SOROLENS" "1" "Nov 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
sorolens-compare - Compare 2 to 5 contracts side by side


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsorolens compare \&... [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Render events, invocations, failure rate, average CPU and fees, health
score and hourly event-volume sparklines for 2 to 5 contracts side by side.

.PP
A contract with no indexed data yet still renders a column: its cells show an
em dash instead of failing the whole comparison. Only request errors (a bad
contract ID, an unreachable API) exit non-zero.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for compare

.PP
\fB--width\fP=0
	Table width in columns (0 detects the terminal, minimum 40)

.PP
\fB--window\fP="24h"
	Window to compare over (24h, 7d or 30d)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	API key for authenticating with the Sorolens API

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Sorolens API base URL

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output machine-readable JSON

.PP
\fB--network\fP=""
	Stellar network (testnet, mainnet, futurenet, standalone)

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--output\fP=""
	Output format (table, json, yaml or jsonl)

.PP
\fB--plugin-api-key\fP[=false]
	When dispatching to a plugin, pass the active profile's API key as SOROLENS_API_KEY (off by default)

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Configuration profile name (default: $SOROLENS_PROFILE, then the default profile)

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	jq-style path filter applied to structured output (e.g. '.items[].name')

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=10s
	Request timeout


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  # Compare two contracts over the last 24 hours
  sorolens compare CAAA... CBBB...

  # Compare five contracts over 7 days
  sorolens compare CAAA... CBBB... CCCC... CDDD... CEEE... --window 7d

  # Machine-readable output for scripts
  sorolens compare CAAA... CBBB... --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBsorolens(1)\fP
